OL,3,GNEWSAFringe ends with 2.8 million
OL,4,Atickets issued - an 8% increase on last
OL,5,Ayear
OL,6,
OL,7,FOver 25 days, the Fringe put on about
OL,8,F4,232 shows from 77 countries with
OL,9,F61,277 performances across 306 venues.
OL,11,FHowever, there have been complaints
OL,12,Ffrom some performers about the later
OL,13,Fstart, which meant that schools
OL,14,Freturned just days after the combined
OL,15,Ffestivals began.
